Subject: [PATCH] Expose the real subject CPU preview only when its permission-gated activity and matching platform signer exist

diff --git a/res/values-nl/unica_subject_preview.xml b/res/values-nl/unica_subject_preview.xml
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/values-nl/unica_subject_preview.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
